A: Masha's brother has written a few lines about himself. Can you read them all on your own?
    draw open_man open_note

    erase open_man open_note

A: Every word comes from lessons one to twenty-nine. Read each short page first, and tap any word you're unsure of.
    draw s1 s2 s3

A: Приве́т! Меня́ зову́т Ива́н.
    highlight s1_words color #c9871a

A: Ма́ша — моя́ сестра́.
    highlight s2_words color #c9871a

A: Мне два́дцать два го́да.
    highlight s3_words color #c9871a

B: Меня́ зову́т Ива́н: his name is Ivan, or word for word, they call me Ivan, as in lesson twenty-one.
    highlight s1_w_2 s1_w_3 color #c9871a

A: Next, Ма́ша — моя́ сестра́: the dash stands in for is.
    highlight s2_words color #c9871a

B: And мне два́дцать два го́да, I am twenty-two.
    highlight s3_words color #c9871a

B: After two comes го́да, as in lesson twenty-nine.
    highlight s3_w_4 color #2a7f86 part а$ effect pulse

    erase s1 s2 s3

A: On to the second page. Read it first, then listen.
    draw s4 s5 s6

A: Я живу́ в О́сло, а Ма́ша живёт в Москве́.
    highlight s4_words color #c9871a

A: Я рабо́таю в рестора́не.
    highlight s5_words color #c9871a

A: У меня́ есть ко́шка.
    highlight s6_words color #c9871a

A: Then where they live: я живу́, Ма́ша живёт, from lesson twenty-three.
    highlight s4_w_1 s4_w_2 s4_w_6 s4_w_7 color #c9871a

A: В О́сло: О́сло never changes.
    highlight s4_w_3 s4_w_4 color #c9871a

A: But Москва́ takes the place ending е: в Москве́.
    highlight s4_w_9 color #2a7f86 part е$ effect pulse

B: Я рабо́таю в рестора́не, I work in a restaurant.
    highlight s5_words color #c9871a

B: Рабо́таю ends in ю, like чита́ю in lesson twenty-two.
    highlight s5_w_2 color #2a7f86 part ю$ effect pulse

A: And у меня́ есть ко́шка, I have a cat, from lesson twenty-eight.
    highlight s6_words color #c9871a

    erase s4 s5 s6

B: And the last page: the cat, the time, and a question for you.
    draw s7 s8 s9

A: Ко́шка лю́бит молоко́, а у меня́ нет молока́!
    highlight s7_words color #c9871a

A: Сего́дня в семь часо́в я иду́ на рабо́ту.
    highlight s8_words color #c9871a

A: А как тебя́ зову́т?
    highlight s9_words color #c9871a

B: The cat loves milk: ко́шка лю́бит молоко́, with лю́бит from lesson twenty-four.
    highlight s7_w_1 s7_w_2 s7_w_3 color #c9871a

A: But у меня́ нет молока́, I have no milk.
    highlight s7_w_5 s7_w_6 s7_w_7 s7_w_8 color #c9871a

A: After нет, молоко́ becomes молока́: lesson twenty-eight's new ending.
    highlight s7_w_8 color #2a7f86 part а$ effect pulse

B: Сего́дня в семь часо́в, today at seven o'clock.
    highlight s8_w_1 s8_w_2 s8_w_3 s8_w_4 color #c9871a

B: Seven is five or more, so часо́в, as in lesson twenty-six.
    highlight s8_w_4 color #2a7f86 part ов$ effect pulse

A: Я иду́ на рабо́ту, I am going to work.
    highlight s8_w_5 s8_w_6 s8_w_7 s8_w_8 color #c9871a

A: Going somewhere, so рабо́та takes the у, from lesson twenty-seven.
    highlight s8_w_8 color #3f7d4e part у$ effect pulse

B: Last, а как тебя́ зову́т? And what's your name? Ivan is asking you.
    highlight s9_words color #c9871a

    erase s7 s8 s9

    quiz "Как его́ зову́т? What is Masha's brother called? Pick one." reveal.text "Меня́ зову́т Ива́н." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Now five questions on the story, from memory.
        right: Ivan: меня́ зову́т Ива́н, in the very first line.
        wrong: Look back at the first line: меня́ зову́т…
        * Том
        + Ива́н
        * Ма́ша

    erase question_1_stamp

    quiz "How old is Ivan? Pick one." reveal.text "Мне два́дцать два го́да." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Twenty-two, and after two comes го́да.
        wrong: Line two: мне два́дцать… how many?
        * два го́да
        + два́дцать два го́да
        * два́дцать пять лет

    erase question_2_stamp

    quiz "Где живёт Ива́н? Where does Ivan live? Pick one." reveal.text "Я живу́ в О́сло." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: In Oslo; it is Masha who lives in Moscow.
        wrong: Masha lives in Moscow. Where does her brother live?
        * в Москве́
        + в О́сло
        * в Ло́ндоне

    erase question_3_stamp

    quiz "What has Ivan run out of? Pick one: у меня́ нет…" reveal.text "У меня́ нет молока́!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Milk, for the cat, with the а after нет.
        wrong: He has a cat and a job. What does the cat love?
        * ко́шки
        + молока́
        * рабо́ты

    erase question_4_stamp

    ask "At what time is Ivan going to work today? Type the number in Russian." answer ["семь","в семь","семь часов","в семь часов"] reveal.text "в семь часо́в" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 72 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Seven: в семь часо́в.
        wrong: Four letters, and one more than шесть.

    erase question_5_stamp

    draw score_cat score_milk parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase score_cat score_milk

    draw grid

A: Now look back at lessons twenty-one to twenty-nine. You can give your name, and use verbs like чита́ю and рабо́таю.
    highlight L21 L22 color #c9871a

B: You can say where you live and what you love, and pay in roubles at the market.
    highlight L23 L24 L25 color #c9871a

A: You can tell the time, say where you're going, and say what you have and what you don't.
    highlight L26 L27 L28 color #c9871a

B: And you can say how old you are. Ivan's note used most of it, and not one word in it was new.
    highlight L29 color #c9871a

    erase grid

B: His last line asked you a question, so answer Ivan out loud: меня́ зову́т, and your name.
    draw end_man end_text

A: О́чень прия́тно! Пока́!
    highlight end_man color #c9871a

